description:
Our project Springr was born out of a personal necessity -- as crypto nomads ourselves, we realized there was a gap in the short-stay market for vibes-based, affordable and on-chain accommodation.

Springr presents unique solutions to 4 key problems/gaps:
(1) Accommodation marketplaces such as couchsurfing/Airbnb recommend you places off filters like location and price — Springr recommends you places based off your on-chain identity (e.g. what NFTs you hold, what DAOs you belong to, where you've been via POAPS);
(2) Pay securely with crypto — not just fiat;
(3) Have all crypto events and listings in one place — select an event to see related listings
(4) Be rewarded for your Springr activity and show it off on-chain. Build an in-app identity via your wallet;
